  <title>Inventory summaries</title>

  <p>Each stock count is kept in a summary. The <gui>Inventory
  summaries</gui> button of <link xref="inventory_count"/> and <link
  xref="inventory_compare"/> lists them, with whether each is still
  <gui>Active</gui>, that is, not yet closed.</p>

  <list>
    <item><p>To start a count, click <gui>New</gui>, type its
    <gui>Name</gui>, choose the <gui>Fiscal year</gui> and the
    <gui>Location</gui> being counted, and click <gui>Save</gui>.</p></item>
    <item><p>To change one, double click it, change it and click
    <gui>Save</gui>.</p></item>
  </list>

</page>
